{
  "detail": "'identifier' is a mandatory Entity member, not an Attribute - it cannot be modified",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid Attribute name",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}


HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 220

{
  "detail": "'identifier' is a mandatory Entity member, not an Attribute - it cannot be replaced",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid Attribute name",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



09. The Entity is untouched by every refusal
============================================

{
  "id": "urn:E1",
  "p": {
    "type": "Property",
    "value": 1
  },
  "scope": "/a",
  "type": "T"
